SOAPBOX: I've had more luck with S&P than a run. I'm sure it's because of
SOAPBOX: the call but I don't think I'll ever change that. I know... be
SOAPBOX: careful what you wish for but I've had this call now for coming
SOAPBOX: on 40 years and sometimes its length is what helps me bust pile
SOAPBOX: ups.it's always fun to work this. I just wish they'd bump it one
SOAPBOX: weekend before or one after. Sure is hard buying time at the rig
SOAPBOX: when company is over, thanksgiving decorations come down and then
SOAPBOX: there is Christmas decorations to be put up. Oh well it is what
SOAPBOX: it is... Always an enjoyable time in the chair no matter how
SOAPBOX: long. 73 until next time.
